@EnviosApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5006

### Registrar usuario (el primero queda como Admin)
POST {{EnviosApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@envios.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### Login (guarda el token en {{login.response.body.token}})
# @name login
POST {{EnviosApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@envios.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### Listar envíos sin token (401)
GET {{EnviosApi_HostAddress}}/api/envios
Accept: application/json

### Listar envíos
GET {{EnviosApi_HostAddress}}/api/envios
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Crear un envío
POST {{EnviosApi_HostAddress}}/api/envios
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "direccion": "Av. Colón 1234",
  "clienteId": 1
}

### Obtener un envío por id
GET {{EnviosApi_HostAddress}}/api/envios/2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Eliminar un envío (solo Admin)
DELETE {{EnviosApi_HostAddress}}/api/envios/2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Cambio de estado
PATCH {{EnviosApi_HostAddress}}/api/envios/3/estado
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{ "estado": "EnTransito" }

### Listar clientes
GET {{EnviosApi_HostAddress}}/api/clientes
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
